Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.18,0:00:09.22,Default,,0,0,0,,The Princess Sapphire\NKnight of the Ribbon
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.00,0:00:50.16,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k72}{\k14}A{\k32}ta{\k40}shi {\k48}no {\k35}mi{\k52}ru {\k45}yu{\k34}me{\k30} {\k41}hi{\k44}mi{\k43}tsu {\k27}na{\k39}no{\k20}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.00,0:00:50.16,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,The dreams I see are my secret
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.25,0:00:57.09,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k53}{\k24}Da{\k13}re{\k25} {\k40}ni {\k36}mo {\k68}iwa{\k68}nai{\k56} {\k43}hi{\k40}mi{\k55}tsu {\k31}na{\k32}no
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.25,0:00:57.09,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,I won’t tell anyone—it’s my secret
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.54,0:01:02.46,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k27}{\k45}A{\k26}ka{\k22}i {\k43}man{\k19}to {\k40}hi{\k26}ra {\k23}hi{\k75}ra{\k46}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.54,0:01:02.46,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,A red cape fluttering
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.46,0:01:04.98,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k0}{\k12}U{\k25}ma {\k21}o {\k18}to{\k28}ba{\k15}su {\k91}ou{\k42}jo
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.46,0:01:04.98,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,Galloping on a horse—the princess
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.98,0:01:06.90,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k28}So{\k27}re {\k21}ga {\k15}a{\k12}{\k23}ta{\k31}shi{\k35}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.98,0:01:06.90,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,That’s me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.62,0:01:10.90,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k12}{\k12}Lu{\k38}la{\k11} {\k20}du{\k10}la{\k19} {\k48}lu{\k53}la {\k43}du{\k40}la{\k22}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.91,0:01:13.42,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k23}{\k26}Lu{\k26}lu{\k13} {\k49}laa, {\k19}lu{\k40}laa{\k55}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.54,0:01:18.02,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k12}{\k12}Lu{\k38}la{\k11} {\k20}du{\k10}la{\k19} {\k48}lu{\k53}la {\k43}du{\k40}la{\k22}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.14,0:01:20.74,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k23}{\k26}Lu{\k26}lu{\k13} {\k49}laa, {\k19}lu{\k40}laa{\k55}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.50,0:01:25.22,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k12}{\k52}Ri{\k44}bon {\k38}no {\k35}ki{\k59}shi {\k115}wa{\k17}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.50,0:01:25.22,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,The Knight of the Ribbon,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.22,0:01:28.62,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k6}{\k50}Hon{\k43}to {\k33}wa {\k92}hon{\k43}tto {\k49}wa{\k24}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.22,0:01:28.62,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,Truly, truly,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.62,0:01:31.82,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k18}{\k23}A{\k23}ta{\k27}shi {\k35}na{\k35}no {\k159}sa{\k0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.62,0:01:31.82,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,It’s really me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.10,0:01:50.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Seventeenth Episode\NThe Greedy Ghost\NGoodbye, Madame Ghost
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.41,0:02:01.49,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s a truly frightening tale.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.52,0:02:05.80,Default,,0,0,0,,The late mistress of that house was incredibly wealthy,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.82,0:02:11.14,Default,,0,0,0,,yet she was such a miser that she did nothing but torment the poor.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.45,0:02:17.04,Default,,0,0,0,,So, you're saying a ghost appears in that house?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.04,0:02:17.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.30,0:02:21.70,Default,,0,0,0,,They became a ghost and still linger inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.15,0:02:25.78,Default,,0,0,0,,So, what's that woman's name?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.52,0:02:28.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Her name is Shylock.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.18,0:02:32.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are you off to? It's already dark outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.94,0:02:37.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Besides, you're in the middle of you're studies right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.57,0:02:40.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll leave the studying to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.34,0:02:41.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Make sure you do it right.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.31,0:02:44.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Underst— Wait, no way!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.08,0:02:45.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Hyah! Out of my way!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.86,0:02:47.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Highness
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.34,0:02:48.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Come play with me in the haunted house!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.43,0:02:51.38,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't leave the castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.06,0:02:55.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Please wait, Lord Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.89,0:03:06.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone stop the Prince!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.32,0:03:08.06,Default,,0,0,0,,He went toward the haunted mansion!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.01,0:03:12.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you hear that, Lord Nylon?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.66,0:03:14.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, the infamous haunted house.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.23,0:03:17.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Follow him and see what he's up to.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.25,0:03:17.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.10,0:03:21.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, but that means I'll have to go inside that haunted house!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.20,0:03:25.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course! You borrowed money from those ghosts before they died, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.57,0:03:28.98,Default,,0,0,0,,You're practically their best customer. Now hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.42,0:04:02.86,Default,,0,0,0,,What thick fog... I can barely see a thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.59,0:04:29.59,Default,,0,0,0,,It went out.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.94,0:04:33.65,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.90,0:04:34.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you scared?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.15,0:04:37.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You're hopeless.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.64,0:04:39.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not scared at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.82,0:04:41.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m a woman, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.30,0:04:50.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you're fired up! That's the way!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.37,0:05:07.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Opal, right here is fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.91,0:05:09.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm staying here tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.55,0:05:10.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Come pick me up in the morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.82,0:05:14.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be fine, really.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.10,0:05:16.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you think I'd lose to a ghost?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.76,0:05:20.78,Default,,0,0,0,,It's fine, you don't need to help.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.98,0:05:22.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Go on home, don't worry about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.96,0:05:24.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.95,0:05:26.49,Default,,0,0,0,,See you tomorrow. Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.50,0:05:40.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.49,0:05:42.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.60,0:05:43.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.66,0:05:49.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait up!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.65,0:06:42.40,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way I can cross this.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.58,0:06:45.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Actually, that works out fine. Time to go home. The frogs are croaking, so back I go.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.96,0:06:53.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it this shallow?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.31,0:06:56.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Opal
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.64,0:07:00.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.24,0:07:05.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Ghost, where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.82,0:07:06.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Come out!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.79,0:07:22.92,Default,,0,0,0,,You think you're guiding me, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.92,0:07:27.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, look at all these books!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.54,0:07:46.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.76,0:07:47.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't mind if I do
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.52,0:07:50.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks delicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.63,0:07:54.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch out, watch out. Can't let myself be tricked.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.73,0:08:09.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't need any of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.85,0:08:18.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I said I don't want it! It's probably just made of stone or mud anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.80,0:08:26.80,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s poultry!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.22,0:08:28.80,Default,,0,0,0,,This is wonderful!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.50,0:08:37.70,Default,,0,0,0,,W-Wait a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.06,0:08:39.06,Default,,0,0,0,,How strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.26,0:08:43.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey Ghost, why are you giving me such royal treatment?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.30,0:08:46.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop doing magic tricks and show yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.86,0:08:48.46,Default,,0,0,0,,So this is Shylock?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.01,0:08:50.01,Default,,0,0,0,,She's so pretty.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.52,0:08:55.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Who?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.63,0:09:05.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Flatterer.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.55,0:09:06.55,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a ghost!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.60,0:09:10.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Indeed I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.46,0:09:11.46,Default,,0,0,0,,A real ghost?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.40,0:09:14.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks convincing, doesn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.59,0:09:15.59,Default,,0,0,0,,You surprised me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.78,0:09:18.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought ghosts looked much more terrifying.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.18,0:09:21.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I could do that too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.86,0:09:23.78,Default,,0,0,0,,But that would only turn people off.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.84,0:09:26.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you treating me to such a feast?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.28,0:09:29.72,Default,,0,0,0,,When you were alive, you were terribly stingy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.75,0:09:32.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, go right ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.29,0:09:35.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I was the stingiest, greediest soul in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.51,0:09:42.05,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why I can't rest in peace, even in death.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.31,0:09:45.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't ascend to Heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.52,0:09:47.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you just force your way up?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.92,0:09:50.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Whenever I call upon Heaven like this...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.33,0:09:55.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, it's Heaven's guide!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.03,0:10:06.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Heaven is calling for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.90,0:10:09.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like you can go to Heaven after all!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.15,0:10:13.76,Default,,0,0,0,,No, this is as far as I ever get.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.87,0:10:20.01,Default,,0,0,0,,What a strange light.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.42,0:10:22.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Ma'am, I'll block the light for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.04,0:10:24.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Quick, climb up while you can!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.99,0:10:25.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.76,0:10:33.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Highness!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.77,0:10:36.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about me, just get up here!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.80,0:10:54.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm... I'm stumped
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.06,0:10:56.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I see, so this is Hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.85,0:11:01.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so miserable, I feel like dying.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.42,0:11:02.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You're already dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.27,0:11:04.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.59,0:11:09.32,Default,,0,0,0,,But how do you get to Heaven?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.00,0:11:13.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, maybe it was the day of your funeral?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.08,0:11:16.04,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I never had a funeral.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.32,0:11:17.64,Default,,0,0,0,,That's it, Ma'am!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.76,0:11:18.76,Default,,0,0,0,,The funeral!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.36,0:11:21.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you can't hold a ceremony without people.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.69,0:11:23.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Ma'am, how many really close friends do you have?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.96,0:11:25.96,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.26,0:11:32.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I have about three old friends, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.84,0:11:34.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Three is fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.82,0:11:37.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me where he is—I'll bring him right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.70,0:11:40.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Why does having a funeral let you go to heaven?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.01,0:11:43.89,Default,,0,0,0,,If everyone cries and mourns at their funeral, I'm sure even the worst villain
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.91,0:11:47.46,Default,,0,0,0,,will be mistaken for a good person and let into heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.05,0:11:51.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine, I'm the villain anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.26,0:11:54.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, I didn't mean it like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.92,0:11:58.62,Default,,0,0,0,,The address is written right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.48,0:12:01.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Here, and here... Okay, I got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.40,0:12:03.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll track them down and ask.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.39,0:12:24.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be afraid. Drink this.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.34,0:12:28.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I lent you money before—did you bring it back?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.08,0:12:31.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Geez, even as a ghost, all she thinks about is money.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.92,0:12:34.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Even ghosts remember money they're owed!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.56,0:12:38.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh dear, no, no. I'll never get into heaven talking like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.12,0:12:39.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Is what you said earlier true?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.37,0:12:41.96,Default,,0,0,0,,So if someone cries for you, you can go to heaven?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.45,0:12:45.04,Default,,0,0,0,,My, aren't you nasty? Were you eavesdropping?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.84,0:12:47.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Then how about I cry for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.25,0:12:53.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Really? I'd be so happy. Please do.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.21,0:12:56.36,Default,,0,0,0,,In return, don't press me about the money.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.54,0:12:59.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I have a condition of my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.44,0:13:02.16,Default,,0,0,0,,What, don't tell me you want to borrow money again?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.15,0:13:04.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Actually, it's about Sapphire.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.95,0:13:07.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Did something happen to the Prince?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.30,0:13:10.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Actually, I want you to get proof of whether the prince is a girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.20,0:13:22.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's see... it's here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.62,0:13:23.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.61,0:13:26.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse me, is this the house that borrowed money from Madame Shy?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.12,0:13:29.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Ooh, ow! I’m seeing stars!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.94,0:13:30.62,Default,,0,0,0,,What a surprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.72,0:13:32.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire, what's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.98,0:13:34.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Tink, where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.36,0:13:37.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Peekaboo! What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.56,0:13:38.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm looking for someone.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.54,0:13:41.22,Default,,0,0,0,,There's this poor person, you see.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.77,0:13:44.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm looking for someone who will cry for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.38,0:13:45.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.04,0:13:47.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I'll help too.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.20,0:13:49.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Tink, you go over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.31,0:13:50.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.34,0:13:55.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry up!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.45,0:13:57.22,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to help the lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.96,0:14:03.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Ma'am, have you ever borrowed money from Shy?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.14,0:14:07.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I borrowed 50 yen, but I paid it back ages ago. Bye!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.82,0:14:14.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.20,0:14:16.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, what do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.31,0:14:17.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I was having a nice nap, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.97,0:14:19.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you you borrow money from Shy?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.41,0:14:22.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I borrowed 30 yen, but I haven't paid it back yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.73,0:14:24.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Then hurry over!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.51,0:14:25.51,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.74,0:14:28.43,Default,,0,0,0,,They said if you cry for her, you don't have to pay it back.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.53,0:14:29.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.96,0:14:34.08,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing? Put me down! Put me down, I say! Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.54,0:14:35.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello, Sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.23,0:14:37.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir, do you know a woman named Shy?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.76,0:14:40.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I sure do. She made me weep, alright.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.60,0:14:42.39,Default,,0,0,0,,My goodness... you’re still crying about it even now?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.50,0:14:43.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Then come with me and cry!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.18,0:14:46.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, please cry for her. Won't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.59,0:14:52.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Delicious!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.35,0:14:55.84,Default,,0,0,0,,If it's a funeral like this, I'd come anytime.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.22,0:14:57.22,Default,,0,0,0,,This is really good!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.01,0:15:04.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that you've eaten your fill, please cry.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.22,0:15:05.82,Default,,0,0,0,,How could I cry for a woman like her?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.85,0:15:09.16,Default,,0,0,0,,When she was alive, she wouldn't even give me a single bean!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.18,0:15:10.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Outrageous!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.63,0:15:11.63,Default,,0,0,0,,What did you say?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.52,0:15:15.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You greedy woman!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.89,0:15:17.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, thanks for the meal.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.39,0:15:18.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Time to head home.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.28,0:15:21.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, cry a little before you go!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.46,0:15:27.28,Default,,0,0,0,,It's no use.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.39,0:15:28.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I ain't cryin'.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.79,0:15:29.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Geez!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.36,0:15:32.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Look here...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.28,0:15:36.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Instead of the money, she took everything from us—our home, our horses, all of it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.97,0:15:39.03,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way I can cry like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.29,0:15:40.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.88,0:15:47.90,Default,,0,0,0,,That's no good.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.32,0:15:49.50,Default,,0,0,0,,This won't make them cry.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.84,0:15:51.65,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll cry for her, won't you, Miss?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.88,0:15:53.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Because she used to work for Shylock!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.96,0:15:54.40,Default,,0,0,0,,No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.90,0:15:58.46,Default,,0,0,0,,She made me work for free for three years and barely even fed me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.93,0:16:03.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone like that shouldn't go to heaven. She can just wander around forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.26,0:16:15.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Heartless monsters! Every last one of them! Even if I am a ghost, this is just too cruel!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.28,0:16:18.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I like money. What's wrong with that?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.37,0:16:21.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me you guys too...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.45,0:16:23.26,Default,,0,0,0,,How boring. Let me go back.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.96,0:16:24.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Good idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.93,0:16:32.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Highness, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.53,0:16:33.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't go back.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.42,0:16:47.42,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.04,0:16:51.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going back again. To the ghost?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.48,0:16:51.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.41,0:16:54.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Why? ...What do you think, Opal?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.69,0:16:59.32,Default,,0,0,0,,See? Opal agrees with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.81,0:17:01.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Tink, you go on back to town.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.12,0:17:03.34,Default,,0,0,0,,That's no fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.57,0:17:04.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, Opal.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.95,0:17:06.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.70,0:17:11.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm just a poor, lonely ghost...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.93,0:17:16.22,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why I said if you grant my request, I'll cry for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.36,0:17:20.40,Default,,0,0,0,,But asking me to check if the Prince is a girl... Oh, he came back!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.80,0:17:21.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Just as I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.16,0:17:23.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Mrs. Ghost, handle this well.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.44,0:17:24.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.75,0:17:27.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome back, Your Highness.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.70,0:17:29.29,Default,,0,0,0,,You were so kind earlier...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.54,0:17:34.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, right this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.88,0:17:37.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Go ahead, Your Highness.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.86,0:17:50.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, how wonderful!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.10,0:17:53.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, right over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.24,0:17:57.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Well? I hope there's a dress you like.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.36,0:17:59.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't make a fool of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.71,0:18:01.20,Default,,0,0,0,,These are all women's clothes!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.82,0:18:03.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, Lady, I am a prince!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.77,0:18:05.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I am a ghost.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.96,0:18:07.55,Default,,0,0,0,,If Lord Sapphire sheds a tear, I will become a girl once more.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.57,0:18:10.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I’ll finally know for certain then... whether he is a boy or a girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.01,0:18:13.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Now then, excuse me for a moment...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.84,0:18:16.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh dear, it's way too baggy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.80,0:18:19.32,Default,,0,0,0,,How about something like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.29,0:18:21.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop it! I said stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.96,0:18:23.70,Default,,0,0,0,,The mirror is over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.62,0:18:26.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh my.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.10,0:18:29.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Here you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.86,0:18:46.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, well. What a strange place to meet, Princess Sapphire.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.42,0:18:47.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Princess Sapphire?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.45,0:18:49.99,Default,,0,0,0,,By the law of this land, a woman cannot become heir to the throne.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.01,0:18:52.66,Default,,0,0,0,, Impersonating a man carries the death penalty.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.69,0:18:53.98,Default,,0,0,0,,The death penalty?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.86,0:18:59.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Would you prefer to be beheaded, or is hanging more to your liking?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.63,0:19:01.74,Default,,0,0,0,,That's absurd, executing such a wonderful person!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.77,0:19:03.73,Default,,0,0,0,,It is the law of the Kingdom of Silverland.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.76,0:19:05.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't butt in, ghost!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.69,0:19:10.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Once you make up your mind, Grand Duke Duralumin will have you killed. I’ll provide the grandest funeral for you, Princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.63,0:19:16.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't care about the kingdom's laws! Executing such a good person is outrageous!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.74,0:19:19.54,Default,,0,0,0,,It should be a happy thing to find out she's a princess. What terrible people!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.04,0:19:22.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry, Princess Sapphire.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.13,0:19:27.10,Default,,0,0,0,,This Nylon is a terrible fellow—you lend him money, and he never pays it back.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.46,0:19:30.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, bad-mouthing him woke him right up.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.12,0:19:33.38,Default,,0,0,0,,What did I bump into?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.66,0:19:35.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Princess, my apologies for keeping you waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.10,0:19:36.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Princess?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.82,0:19:38.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you calling "Princess"?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.78,0:19:44.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You are a woman. I just saw it with my own eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.29,0:19:45.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, with those eyes?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.06,0:19:47.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Then take another good look.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.67,0:19:53.68,Default,,0,0,0,,When did you find the time to change her clothes, Madame Shy? No doubt about it... this one is a woman!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.71,0:19:54.42,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.78,0:19:56.60,Default,,0,0,0,,See? Even the Madame says no.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.78,0:19:57.06,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.64,0:20:00.62,Default,,0,0,0,,No, Prince Sapphire is a fine prince.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.78,0:20:01.78,Default,,0,0,0,,That can't be!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.95,0:20:02.53,Default,,0,0,0,,He certainly is.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.69,0:20:03.92,Default,,0,0,0,,The dress in this wardrobe...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.15,0:20:08.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Dressed as a woman before this mirror...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.74,0:20:15.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Madame Shy, how dare you betray me!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.38,0:20:15.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Just you wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.99,0:20:18.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll post guards around this mansion and let no one in!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.68,0:20:20.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Then there'll be no one left to weep for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.52,0:20:24.64,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll become a ghost in this mansion forever and suffer the torments of hell!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.29,0:20:27.56,Default,,0,0,0,,What was that about?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.79,0:20:28.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire, you're a woman, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.21,0:20:34.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Prince Sapphire is...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.54,0:20:38.83,Default,,0,0,0,,...a man.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.07,0:20:42.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll regret this!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.75,0:20:47.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Ma'am, why did you waste such a great chance...?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.39,0:20:49.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know. I don't understand it myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.46,0:20:52.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Light!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.72,0:20:54.34,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks like you’re going to Heaven, Ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.37,0:21:01.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll give it a try. Thank you, Prince.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.11,0:21:06.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch out, Ma'am!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.77,0:21:11.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Help! Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.00,0:21:14.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess it didn't work out after all, Ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.02,0:21:21.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Poor Prince... I hate Heaven. Why do Heaven and Hell even exist in the afterlife?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.04,0:21:22.84,Default,,0,0,0,,If I just died, then nothing...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.50,0:21:25.54,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that sound?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.17,0:21:30.42,Default,,0,0,0,,The ghost is over there!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.60,0:21:32.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Set fire to the room and burn it down!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.17,0:21:35.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, they're trying to burn down the mansion!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.78,0:21:36.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't let them!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.39,0:21:39.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn those men!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.76,0:21:41.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Men, set fires everywhere!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.21,0:21:44.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, burn! Burn!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.84,0:21:53.52,Default,,0,0,0,,It's useless to burn it to ashes, Nylon.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.71,0:21:55.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it, what are you doing? Burn it down!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.73,0:21:58.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Nylon, stop setting fires!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.27,0:21:59.27,Default,,0,0,0,,It's an order from the Prince!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.91,0:22:01.24,Default,,0,0,0,,No, you are no prince.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.34,0:22:03.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Lady Sapphire, you are a woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.67,0:22:05.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Quick, seize Princess Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.88,0:22:09.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright! If that's the case, I’ll definitely put this fire out!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.36,0:22:10.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Ma'am, please put out the fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.28,0:22:24.28,Default,,0,0,0,,She's in danger!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.28,0:22:27.62,Default,,0,0,0,,This mansion is done for.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.45,0:22:30.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Now then... you’re about to become a beggar ghost!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.65,0:22:31.65,Default,,0,0,0,,A beggar ghost!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.15,0:22:34.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, get your hands off!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.63,0:22:36.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Ma'am, it's dangerous over there!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.97,0:22:41.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Ma'am, so this is where you were!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.66,0:22:42.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's get out of here, quick!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.78,0:22:46.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a ghost, so I'm fine. I'm just exhausted...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.66,0:22:48.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Highness, look out!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.90,0:22:50.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, run away!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.82,0:22:51.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.46,0:22:53.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry for all the trouble...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.04,0:22:56.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I've given up now.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.68,0:22:58.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you really okay with not going to Heaven?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.19,0:22:59.83,Default,,0,0,0,,It's fine. Please, just run!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.95,0:23:02.10,Default,,0,0,0,,The mansion will burn down any second.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.45,0:23:05.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Nylon and his men are after your life, so please be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.75,0:23:07.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You care about me that much...?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.11,0:23:09.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, Ma'am!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.27,0:23:11.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Sapphire, please be careful...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.26,0:23:14.24,Default,,0,0,0,,To think she worried about me this much...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.05,0:23:16.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.76,0:23:23.72,Default,,0,0,0,,The fire... The fire stopped! What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.97,0:23:28.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Prince Sapphire, because you wept for me, I can go to heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.32,0:23:30.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Get outside while the flames have stopped!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.64,0:23:31.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.22,0:23:46.00,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Prince Sapphire's ghost!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.14,0:23:46.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Nylon!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.03,0:23:48.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Well well, my Prince, you managed to escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.12,0:23:51.25,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way, what happened to Shy's ghost?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.22,0:23:59.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Look. Madame Shy is ascending to Heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.73,0:24:06.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodbye, Ma'am!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.34,0:24:37.96,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k29}{\k22}Ta{\k18}ra{\k16}ri {\k18}Ra{\k20}tta {\k23}Ri{\k19}tta {\k26}Ra{\k17}tta {\k19}Ra{\k66}tta{\k69}ttaa
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.96,0:24:41.32,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k8}{\k46}Kya{\k68}hoo! {\k35}Kya{\k42}hoo! {\k46}Kya{\k91}hoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.96,0:24:41.32,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,Yahoo! Yahoo! Yahoo!
